      "originalText": "LOCK ≠ LEASE\n\nLock: milisegundos al CLAIM.\nLease: dura el intento y el\nheartbeat la renueva.\n\nSpot muere → lease vence\n→ QUEUED → otro Worker\nretoma checkpoint si existe.",
